oleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"Clitopho","textMapHash":2285008906,"text":"Weasel Thieves trained by Treasure Hoarders are fed at fixed hours in a day. There are three types of Weasel Thieves...","nextNodeIds":[710660807]},{"nodeId":710660807,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"Clitopho","textMapHash":2263793322,"text":"The Golden Weasel Thief is the most cunning one... Then, there's the more common Hoarder Weasel Thief. The dumbest of all is the Amateur Weasel Thief. Well, as for when they show up...","nextNodeIds":[710660808]},{"nodeId":710660808,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"Clitopho","textMapHash":2602041002,"text":"*sigh* There should be a training manual somewhere with the feeding timetable on it, as no one really bothered to remember the exact time. The manual should be in the camp frequented by Weasel Thieves.","nextNodeIds":[710660809]},{"nodeId":710660809,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"Clitopho","textMapHash":2218251546,"text":"Ah... I almost forgot this! Give a whistle if you want to summon them.","nextNodeIds":[710660810]},{"nodeId":710660810,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1262963386,"text":"Give a whistle?","nextNodeIds":[710660811]},{"nodeId":710660811,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2617,"speakerName":"Clitopho","textMapHash":143371866,"text":"Yep, just any old whistle will do. It's not some complicated trick. The key is the timing.","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":1,"LNHLPKELCAL":[101641,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_OBTAIN_ITEM","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG"